.TH AD_SUGGEST 1 "2026-08-30" "ad 2.0" "ad scripts"
.SH NAME
ad_suggest \- suggest the closest matching CLI option for a typo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_suggest
.I <wrong_option>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_suggest
is a helper script that suggests the closest matching CLI option for a mistyped flag. It uses a Hamming-distance-like comparison to find the best match from the known option list.
.PP
This script is sourced by
.BR ad_vim (1)
and
.BR ad_pipeline (1)
when the user passes an unknown option — the "Did you mean?" suggestion.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Show help and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B ad_suggest --hlep
Suggests: --help
.TP
.B ad_suggest --indent-lsat
Suggests: --indent-last
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ad_vim (1),
.BR ad_pipeline (1)
